HaKoniwalily is a singing group consisting of Hanon and Kotoha. The two have been doing both solo and group activities on YouTube since before forming the unit officially in June, 2021. They are also known to have been working with and under HoneyWorks on many occasions, including being guest singers for HoneyWorks, and the release of two indie albums produced by HoneyWorks.

Twitter: @HaKoniwalily
