@Hanon_moco

Birthplace: Makuhari, Chiba Prefecture, Japan

Yuuri is a singer-songwriter and YouTuber. He is currently signed to Sony Music Entertainment's label Ariola Japan. He started as a vocalist for the 4-man rock band The Bugzy, but became a solo artist when they disbanded in May of 2019. He formally debuted with his single Kakurenbo in December of the same year.

(Source: Wikipedia)

