nqrse (pronounced Naruse) is an utaite and rapper who started activities on Niconico in March of 2013, after uploading his original song Emotional. He released his first album, Natsu Comi Otoshimashita (夏コミ落としました), in August of 2016. He chose the name Naruse (成瀬) because he thought it sounded cool, and replaced the a with q because he thought it looked like the letter alpha (α). The u disappeared due to a typo.

nqrse has been part of the group AraNaruMey (あらなるめい) with fellow utaite ARAKI and Meychan since January of 2020.

